<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (Each company sees only its own documents and results. Every model call goes through one gateway, which checks who is asking, which company the data belongs to and whether the route is allowed. If no route is allowed, the analysis stops and nothing is sent outside. A local model alone does not make data private, so we rely on these checks. Today this is designed, and tests with two test companies will prove it.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
